      "KRSQSYHU7rxGri6O": {
        "name": "Pack Hunter",
        "value": 3,
        "description": ""
      }
    },
    "tier": 1,
    "description": "<p>A person transformed into a wingless draconic predator by a weredragon’s breath weapon.</p><p>A weredrake looks like a wingless, quadrupedal dragon of a similar size to the person they once were, but they can’t speak and don’t retain that person’s knowledge or memories. Elements of the weredrake’s former ancestry might be discernible in the creature’s form; for example, a clank transformed into a weredrake might retain a mechanical appearance, while a faerie weredrake might have a carapace instead of scales.</p>",
